msgstr "För en ren portering till v4.1.0 är det typiska arbetet:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:131
msgid ""
"Port NINA/RP2 WiFi code to the standard :class:`network.WLAN` interface "
"(``WLAN(interface)``, ``active()``, ``essid=``) and expect a tuple from "
"``nina.fw_version()`` (:ref:`the WiFi API change <v4_1_0_wifi>`)."
msgstr ""
"Porta NINA/RP2 WiFi-kod till standardgränssnittet :class:`network.WLAN` (\\ "
"``WLAN(interface)``\\ , ``active()``\\ , ``essid=``\\ ) och förvänta dig en "
"tupel från ``nina.fw_version()`` (\\ :ref:`WiFi-API-ändringen "
"<v4_1_0_wifi>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"Change ``except ValueError`` to ``except RuntimeError`` around camera / "
":func:`sensor.reset` error handling (:ref:`the sensor-error change "
"<v4_1_0_errors>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ändra ``except ValueError`` till ``except RuntimeError`` kring felhantering "
"för kamera / :func:`sensor.reset` (\\ :ref:`sensorfelsändringen "
"<v4_1_0_errors>`\\ )."
